  'SignalScout combines contact data enrichment with real-time buying signal detection — so you always know who to call and exactly when to call them.',
  'SignalScout is a B2B intelligence platform that surfaces verified email addresses, direct dials, and firmographic data for any company or contact. Its proprietary Buying Signal Engine tracks job changes, tech stack updates, and funding events to alert you when a prospect is actively in-market.',
  'https://signalscout.example.com',
  ARRAY['Contact Data','Lead Intelligence','Sales Intelligence'],
  'sales',
  'Paid',
  1,
  5.0, 310, true, 'active', true,
  '[{"title":"Buying Signal Engine","description":"Alerts you when prospects change jobs, receive funding, or add new tech to their stack."},{"title":"Data Waterfall","description":"Queries 12 data providers in sequence to maximize contact data coverage."},{"title":"Chrome Extension","description":"Reveals contact data and signals directly on LinkedIn profiles."}]',
  to_jsonb(ARRAY['Best contact data coverage in the market','Buying signals are highly actionable','Chrome extension is a standout feature']),
  to_jsonb(ARRAY['Premium pricing','Data freshness varies by geography']),
  'Sales teams that prioritize precision prospecting over high-volume cold outreach.',
